Package: replconnect
Title: Connect to an R Session from Neovim
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Callum Arnold", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "contact@callumarnold.com")
Description: Serves the R session's variables, a grid viewer, runtime
    completion and plots to the replconnect Neovim plugin over a Unix-domain
    socket, using the REPLConnect protocol (docs/protocol.md). Designed for the
    arf console, where requests are handled on R's main thread while R is idle
    at the prompt.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    methods,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    tibble,
    data.table,
    unigd
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc; Unix (Linux, macOS)
OS_type: unix
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/rextendr/version: 0.4.0
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
